|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{Tablerow3|'''Open Instanced World'''|Ctrl-Shift-O|If any instanced worlds are selected, this opens their world files in separate world editors.}}&lt;br /&gt;
|}&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
